    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d196">

                <pb facs="0398" n="364" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v15p1/pg364"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">FE files, lot 55 D 128: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commander in Chief, United Nations Command (Clark)
                        to the Joint Chiefs of Staff</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret<lb/>operational
                            immediate</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1952-06-28T23:15:00+09:00">June 28, 1952—11:15
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>CX 51050. Re CX 50050.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d196-f1"/></p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Basic statistics from present POW screening operation in Korea indicate
                        that total number of POW and CIs to be returned to Communists control will
                        exceed 80,000. This increase over 70,000 figure can best be used to our
                        advantage by the submission of a new figure to the Communists in open
                        plenary session. This action should be accompanied by a full and complete
                        explanation as to how such figure was obtained, stressing its finality and
                        the objective way in which the screening was conducted. After statement is
                        given to the Communists it should be released to the press
                        immediately.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Strongly recommend that the UNC delegation be authorized to submit a new
                        final figure to the Communists as soon as available in accordance with the
                        procedure outlined in Para 1 above.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>The statement to be made at the time of submission of new figure is under
                        preparation now and will be furnished you in advance.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
